start": 652.24, "end": 654.24, "text": "which has given me and epiphany of my own."}, {"start": 654.24, "end": 656.24, "text": "The Dean is a genius."}, {"start": 656.24, "end": 657.24, "text": "He has to be."}, {"start": 657.24, "end": 659.24, "text": "If he isn't, I've given almost two weeks of my life"}, {"start": 659.24, "end": 660.74, "text": "Two weeks of my life, too, an idiot."}, {"start": 660.74, "end": 662.34, "text": "That is unacceptable, therefore."}, {"start": 662.34, "end": 667.78, "text": "The Dean is a genius, and I will die protecting his vision."}, {"start": 667.78, "end": 670.54, "text": "Are you by any chance familiar with Stockholm's control?"}, {"start": 670.54, "end": 671.94, "text": "Is it something that the Dean created?"}, {"start": 671.94, "end": 673.5, "text": "Because if not, I don't care."}, {"start": 673.5, "end": 675.86, "text": "We all want to go with the Dean won't let us."}, {"start": 675.86, "end": 678.26, "text": "I think Pierce played this as smart as for the beginning."}, {"start": 678.26, "end": 680.02, "text": "He's probably at home watching forensic files"}, {"start": 680.02, "end": 681.1, "text": "and eating cheesy popcorn."}, {"start": 686.62, "end": 688.82, "text": "Wow, about time!"}, {"start": 688.82, "end": 691.58, "text": "Hey, that's Feloise Guzman."}, {"start": 691.58, "end": 693.34, "text": "Well, when you get me my trail,"}, {"start": 693.34, "end": 694.98, "text": "and he can have it back,"}, {"start": 694.98, "end": 697.7, "text": "and make it as nice as this one."}, {"start": 697.7, "end": 698.7, "text": "They deem."}, {"start": 698.7, "end": 700.1, "text": "They deem."}, {"start": 700.1, "end": 701.98, "text": "Here's mistook me for the dean today."}, {"start": 701.98, "end": 702.86, "text": "I want windows."}, {"start": 702.86, "end": 705.18, "text": "How did that make you feel?"}, {"start": 705.18, "end": 707.42, "text": "I've become a stranger to myself."}, {"start": 707.42, "end": 708.78, "text": "I'm bald now."}, {"start": 708.78, "end": 710.7, "text": "I've always been bald."}, {"start": 710.7, "end": 712.94, "text": "I'm really dreamt of having here."}, {"start": 712.94, "end": 715.46, "text": "And now, the bald man is awake."}, {"start": 715.46, "end": 717.3, "text": "Jeff?"}, {"start": 717.3, "end": 718.3, "text": "It's time."}, {"start": 722.58, "end": 723.58, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 723.58, "end": 724.94, "text": "Cam?"}, {"start": 724.94, "end": 725.82, "text": "Dean."}, {"start": 725.82, "end": 727.74, "text": "Action."}, {"start": 727.74, "end": 729.34, "text": "Why go Greendale?"}, {"start": 729.34, "end": 731.14, "text": "Just because."}, {"start": 731.14, "end": 732.02, "text": "Cut."}, {"start": 732.02, "end": 732.86, "text": "Cut."}, {"start": 735.66, "end": 737.58, "text": "Lose the bald cap."}, {"start": 737.58, "end": 738.22, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 738.22, "end": 739.18, "text": "I don't like it."}, {"start": 739.18, "end": 739.74, "text": "It's hokey."}, {"start": 739.74, "end": 740.46, "text": "It's fake."}, {"start": 740.46, "end": 741.46, "text": "Take it off."}, {"start": 745.46, "end": 746.46, "text": "No."}, {"start": 749.86, "end": 751.54, "text": "I make you a pardon."}, {"start": 751.54, "end": 756.3, "text": "Actor, I have worn this stupid thing for 12 days."}, {"start": 756.3, "end": 757.98, "text": "I have made bald friends."}, {"start": 757.98, "end": 759.58, "text": "That's a mistake."}, {"start": 759.58, "end": 760.78, "text": "Because it's a lie."}, {"start": 760.78, "end": 761.82, "text": "It's Hollywood crap."}, {"start": 761.82, "end": 764.18, "text": "And I want to lie within my commercial."}, {"start": 764.18, "end": 766.66, "text": "You are not."}, {"start": 766.66, "end": 768.38, "text": "Oh, yes."}, {"start": 768.38, "end": 769.38, "text": "I am."}, {"start": 769.38, "end": 772.66, "text": "Well, then, you're wrong for the part!"}, {"start": 772.66, "end": 774.86, "text": "Under study!"}, {"start": 775.46, "end": 778.46, "text": "[sighs]"}, {"start": 780.46, "end": 781.96, "text": "That's it."}, {"start": 781.96, "end": 784.46, "text": "That's reality."}, {"start": 784.46, "end": 787.46, "text": "When you're done, go home."}, {"start": 787.46, "end": 789.46, "text": "Go home."}, {"start": 789.46, "end": 792.46, "text": "Okay, I don't know why, but this is the last straw."}, {"start": 792.46, "end": 794.46, "text": "As a licensed psychology major,"}, {"start": 794.46, "end": 798.46, "text": "I am declaring this production of violation of human rights."}, {"start": 798.46, "end": 801.46, "text": "You have made us prisoners of your insanity."}, {"start": 801.46, "end": 804.46, "text": "Shut your face, Prita! If the Dean wants his role"}, {"start": 804.46, "end": 808.62, "text": "to be played by a Chinese man in a blonde whip."}, {"start": 808.62, "end": 809.94, "text": "Oh my god, you are insane."}, {"start": 809.94, "end": 812.7, "text": "All right, I'm sick and tired of hearing complaints"}, {"start": 812.7, "end": 814.82, "text": "that I'm forcing people to be here."}, {"start": 814.82, "end": 818.66, "text": "Hey, anyone who doesn't want to help me can leave."}, {"start": 823.7, "end": 826.74, "text": "[MUSIC PLAYING]"}, {"start": 831.9, "end": 833.1, "text": "I've been stopped."}, {"start": 833.1, "end": 835.3, "text": "OK."}, {"start": 835.3, "end": 835.8, "text": "Keep rolling."}, {"start": 847.86, "end": 850.3, "text": "Hello, hello, hello."}, {"start": 858.86, "end": 863.36, "text": "♪ Low with me, little man ♪"}, {"start": 863.36, "end": 864.2, "text": "Hello?"}, {"start": 864.2, "end": 865.36, "text": "- Hi, hi."}, {"start": 865.36, "end": 866.66, "text": "- Mr. Guzman."}, {"start": 866.66, "end": 869.46, "text": "- Deans, last director, Craig Pelton."}, {"start": 869.46, "end": 871.16, "text": "- Sorry, I've been editing."}, {"start": 871.16, "end": 872.94, "text": "It's a little bit of a mess."}, {"start": 875.3, "end": 876.76, "text": "What the (beep) is that?"}, {"start": 876.76, "end": 877.9, "text": "- Oh, that's a possum."}, {"start": 877.9, "end": 879.2, "text": "Which has been some time with them."}, {"start": 879.2, "end": 881.22, "text": "You see they're just like big gentle rats."}, {"start": 884.72, "end": 885.48, "text": "- Oh, look at her."}, {"start": 885.48, "end": 886.4, "text": "- I'm no one."}, {"start": 886.4, "end": 887.24, "text": "- That's a hot bed."}, {"start": 887.24, "end": 889.12, "text": "a little bit odd."}, {"start": 889.12, "end": 892.0, "text": "Now, without further ado, here is the commercial you"}, {"start": 892.0, "end": 893.0, "text": "will be starring in."}, {"start": 897.52, "end": 900.52, "text": "[MUSIC PLAYING]"}, {"start": 912.4, "end": 914.6, "text": "I got to make a focal."}, {"start": 914.6, "end": 917.36, "text": "I had to tell this thing I couldn't do his commercial."}, {"start": 917.36, "end": 918.86, "text": "He didn't take that to Alida."}, {"start": 919.96, "end": 921.2, "text": "Y'all gotta help this dude."}, {"start": 921.2, "end": 922.52, "text": "I'm gonna hurry to his friends."}, {"start": 922.52, "end": 924.56, "text": "- A more of a fly on the wall."}, {"start": 924.56, "end": 925.4, "text": "- What is it?"}, {"start": 926.36, "end": 927.2, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 928.52, "end": 930.08, "text": "- You would be in my commercial,"}, {"start": 930.08, "end": 932.36, "text": "but you'll be in his stupid documentary."}, {"start": 932.36, "end": 934.0, "text": "Only just as follow people around."}, {"start": 934.0, "end": 936.0, "text": "- Yeah, but haven't you seen how to dog this?"}, {"start": 936.0, "end": 938.04, "text": "- Way better than a hell of a my chemistry"}, {"start": 938.04, "end": 939.88, "text": "and grateful backstabber."}, {"start": 939.88, "end": 941.32, "text": "I already got rid of your trailer."}, {"start": 941.32, "end": 942.32, "text": "I had a trailer."}, {"start": 943.48, "end": 944.72, "text": "Can anyone hear me?"}, {"start": 944.72, "end": 947.04, "text": "I will walk off this bird after it."}, {"start": 947.04, "end": 948.92, "text": "I will quit."}, {"start": 948.92, "end": 949.6, "text": "Hello?"}, {"start": 949.6, "end": 951.68, "text": "I come here to shoot this commercial for greener."}, {"start": 951.68, "end": 953.16, "text": "That's what you have written in the script."}, {"start": 953.16, "end": 954.64, "text": "Oh, that script was terrible."}, {"start": 954.64, "end": 955.72, "text": "I thought it was pretty good."}, {"start": 955.72, "end": 958.32, "text": "Of course you think that you went here."}, {"start": 962.2, "end": 965.08, "text": "Oh, I got it."}, {"start": 965.08, "end": 967.8, "text": "You're worse than crazy."}, {"start": 967.8, "end": 969.4, "text": "You're a shame at your school."}, {"start": 969.4, "end": 971.36, "text": "And that statue of me out there?"}, {"start": 971.36, "end": 972.52, "text": "That's just wrong, man."}, {"start": 972.52, "end": 974.04, "text": "The bronze adds 10 pounds."}, {"start": 974.04, "end": 975.56, "text": "- No, I'm not gonna be perfect."}, {"start": 975.56, "end": 977.4, "text": "- Screw you."}, {"start": 977.4, "end": 980.44, "text": "I'm just saying, don't worship the people leaving green."}, {"start": 980.44, "end": 982.64, "text": "They worship the people that are here."}, {"start": 982.64, "end": 984.32, "text": "Worship this place."}, {"start": 984.32, "end": 985.8, "text": "It changes people's lives."}, {"start": 985.8, "end": 987.4, "text": "Look, I love my time."}, {"start": 987.4, "end": 989.28, "text": "I got laid like crazy."}, {"start": 989.28, "end": 991.72, "text": "That's way before Billie and I still look."}, {"start": 993.08, "end": 995.12, "text": "This is a special school."}, {"start": 998.4, "end": 999.8, "text": "You don't deserve to be here."}, {"start": 1002.52, "end": 1009.16, "text": "Are you still filming up at--"}, {"start": 1009.16, "end": 1010.46, "text": "Yeah, but try not to address me."}, {"start": 1010.46, "end": 1011.56, "text": "I'm not really here."}, {"start": 1011.56, "end": 1014.76, "text": "Either or not."}, {"start": 1014.76, "end": 1018.76, "text": "I don't think I can finish my commercial."}, {"start": 1018.76, "end": 1022.8, "text": "But I think I know how your documentary ends."}, {"start": 1022.8, "end": 1024.96, "text": "[MUSIC PLAYING]"}, {"start": 1024.96, "end": 1030.24, "text": "Hi, I'm Craig Pilton, Dean of Greendale Community College."}, {"start": 1030.24, "end": 1035.24, "text": "I have failed this school."}, {"start": 1035.24, "end": 1039.24, "text": "I have failed it because I thought I was better than Green Day."}, {"start": 1039.24, "end": 1044.24, "text": "See, I went to a university, so I thought it was my job to improve this place."}, {"start": 1044.24, "end": 1049.24, "text": "But it turns out that the only thing wrong with Green Day is that it's run by an insecure wreck,"}, {"start": 1049.24, "end": 1056.24, "text": "who holds five dances and two talent shows a year because he's afraid that the school isn't good enough."}, {"start": 1056.24, "end": 1060.24, "text": "But Greendale is good enough because it accepts me for when I'm not."}, {"start": 1060.24, "end": 1064.24, "text": "Greendale is the best school in the entire world."}, {"start": 1064.24, "end": 1067.24, "text": "And I'm so sorry what I've done to it."}, {"start": 1067.24, "end": 1070.24, "text": "And I'm sorry what I've done to the ice cream shape."}, {"start": 1070.24, "end": 1072.24, "text": "[screaming]"}, {"start": 1072.24, "end": 1077.24, "text": "Please no one eat out of it until you're clean the noses."}, {"start": 1077.24, "end": 1080.24, "text": "The janitor knows how."}, {"start": 1080.24, "end": 1083.24, "text": "I'm horrible."}, {"start": 1083.24, "end": 1085.24, "text": "I'm horrible."}, {"start": 1085.24, "end": 1087.84, "text": "[MUSIC PLAYING]"}, {"start": 1087.84, "end": 1089.72, "text": "Gentlemen, what I'm about to show you"}, {"start": 1089.72, "end": 1091.88, "text": "is not the commercial you paid me to create."}, {"start": 1091.88, "end": 1094.72, "text": "What I am about to show you is a glimpse into my mind."}, {"start": 1094.72, "end": 1097.2, "text": "And so please hold your questions until the end."}, {"start": 1097.2, "end": 1098.92, "text": "I know you will have a lot of them,"}, {"start": 1098.92, "end": 1101.2, "text": "but I'll understand if you'd rather I just leave."}, {"start": 1106.2, "end": 1108.2, "text": "Why do I go green, Dale?"}, {"start": 1108.2, "end": 1110.16, "text": "The doom is a genius."}, {"start": 1110.16, "end": 1112.04, "text": "To meet different people."}, {"start": 1112.04, "end": 1113.48, "text": "With three kids at home, you better"}, {"start": 1113.48, "end": 1115.16, "text": "I believe every penny counts."}, {"start": 1115.16, "end": 1116.36, "text": "I love my time."}, {"start": 1116.36, "end": 1118.16, "text": "Yeah, I got laid in my crazy--"}, {"start": 1118.16, "end": 1119.32, "text": "So why should you?"}, {"start": 1119.32, "end": 1120.2, "text": "Why should you?"}, {"start": 1120.2, "end": 1122.92, "text": "Why should you go to Greendale?"}, {"start": 1122.92, "end": 1127.48, "text": "Greendale is the best school in the entire world."}, {"start": 1127.48, "end": 1129.32, "text": "Go Greendale, Greendale, go!"}, {"start": 1132.28, "end": 1133.0, "text": "It's good."}, {"start": 1133.0, "end": 1133.64, "text": "You know what?"}, {"start": 1133.64, "end": 1134.92, "text": "Better than good."}, {"start": 1134.92, "end": 1135.76, "text": "Good enough."}, {"start": 1135.76, "end": 1138.84, "text": "Is there any more of the crazy Chinese guy?"}, {"start": 1138.84, "end": 1139.68, "text": "He pops."}, {"start": 1139.68, "end": 1140.56, "text": "I'm confused."}, {"start": 1140.56, "end": 1141.64, "text": "That's not my commercial."}, {"start": 1141.64, "end": 1142.8, "text": "I didn't make that."}, {"start": 1142.8, "end": 1145.8, "text": "Yeah, yeah, okay, Zemeckas, it moved through you."}, {"start": 1145.8, "end": 1147.76, "text": "Anyway, congratulations."}, {"start": 1147.76, "end": 1150.52, "text": "That should last us another 16 years."}, {"start": 1150.52, "end": 1152.76, "text": "No, huh, what's next?"}, {"start": 1152.76, "end": 1155.0, "text": "Chump's rusty bucket, quarter taps."}, {"start": 1160.12, "end": 1160.96, "text": "Did you do this?"}, {"start": 1160.96, "end": 1161.88, "text": "You did mostly."}, {"start": 1161.88, "end": 1163.56, "text": "You got the footage you needed at the first day."}, {"start": 1163.56, "end": 1165.72, "text": "I added a little bit of my footage to fill in the gaps."}, {"start": 1168.8, "end": 1170.52, "text": "I thought you were flying on the wall."}, {"start": 1170.52, "end": 1172.32, "text": "Some flies are too awesome for the wall."}, {"start": 1172.8, "end": 1179.44, "text": "Documentarians are supposed to be objective to avoid having any effect on the story and yet we have more effect than anyone because we decide to tell it"}, {"start": 1180.0, "end": 1185.4, "text": "And we decide how it ends will your story be yet another sad one of yet another man who just wanted to be happy or"}, {"start": 1185.68, "end": 1191.4, "text": "Will your story acknowledge the very nature of stories and embrace the fact that sharing the sad ones can sometimes make them happy"}, {"start": 1193.2, "end": 1195.2, "text": "Before you say anything"}, {"start": 1195.84, "end": 1198.8, "text": "Nope, I've got nothing. Can you just forgive me?"}, {"start": 1202.8, "end": 1204.8, "text": "Yep."}, {"start": 1204.8, "end": 1206.8, "text": "Yep."}, {"start": 1206.8, "end": 1208.8, "text": "Why?"}, {"start": 1208.8, "end": 1210.8, "text": "Because we've all been there."}, {"start": 1210.8, "end": 1212.8, "text": "Which is why we're all here."}, {"start": 1217.8, "end": 1220.8, "text": "Oh."}, {"start": 1220.8, "end": 1222.8, "text": "I'm a good dean."}, {"start": 1222.8, "end": 1224.8, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 1224.8, "end": 1229.8, "text": "Can someone help me get a live possum out of my office?"}, {"start": 1229.8, "end": 1230.9, "text": "- I don't know."}, {"start": 1230.9, "end": 1233.5, "text": "- It just keeps jumping and skittering."}, {"start": 1233.5, "end": 1236.78, "text": "You think you're prepared and it skippers again?"}, {"start": 1238.7, "end": 1239.98, "text": "- Okay, see you in Zolver."}, {"start": 1239.98, "end": 1240.82, "text": "- Hmm?"}, {"start": 1248.78, "end": 1251.36, "text": "(upbeat music)"}, {"start": 1252.66, "end": 1254.86, "text": "- We'll be ready for you in 20 minutes, Mr. Garland."}, {"start": 1254.86, "end": 1255.7, "text": "- Right."}, {"start": 1255.7, "end": 1256.7, "text": "(doorbell rings)"}, {"start": 1256.7, "end": 1257.86, "text": "- Linus, stop!"}, {"start": 1259.8, "end": 1262.8, "text": "I will not be mitigated."}, {"start": 1267.8, "end": 1268.8, "text": "Okay, you know what?"}, {"start": 1268.8, "end": 1270.8, "text": "I'm not coming out of this trailer"}, {"start": 1270.8, "end": 1272.8, "text": "and talking to new trailer."}, {"start": 1275.8, "end": 1277.8, "text": "Hey, get me a granola bar!"}]}